WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.474
Today we will connect the form of a useful object to its function. Our work connects

00:00:05.474 --> 00:00:06.792
with communities across Africa.

00:00:07.617 --> 00:00:10.817
Observe the pot rim, body, base and any decoration.

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:14.198
Draw the outline using simple curved lines.

00:00:15.617 --> 00:00:21.009
Add a label showing how the pot might be used. Explain one respectful similarity or

00:00:21.009 --> 00:00:22.806
difference with another African example.
